# Level 3 needs three other nonland permanents to sacrifice: Bot1 has Mox Jet, Mox Emerald and Hithlain Rope, but the Rope
# can't be sacrificed (CR 101.2: it is no option), so at the beginning of its end step in turn 5 the "you may" is never asked
# (`! Bot1.Accept`) and nothing is sacrificed. The sibling scenario with three Moxen is asked.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Scavenger's Talent
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Hithlain Rope
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

