Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Hithlain Rope.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Scavenger's Talent.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
